{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>Tomorrow</b> — Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: 'Do not boast of tomorrow' (Proverbs 27:1). The Holy One, blessed be He, said to Jacob: Do you know what will be tomorrow? 'Do not boast of tomorrow' — and tomorrow your daughter Dinah goes forth from you."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:25.335805683Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}